        <briefdescription>
<para>Try to match <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">Instruction</ref> &quot;I&quot; as a comparison against a constant and populates the array Vals with the set of values that match (or do not match depending on isEQ). </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Return false on failure. On success, the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> the comparison matched against is placed in CompValue. If CompValue is already set, the function is expected to fail if a match is found but the value compared to is different. </para>
